      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.19,
      "end_seconds": 6.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "let me think hello? Doctor? I was told to come in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.37,
      "end_seconds": 15.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 16.84,
      "end_seconds": 21.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "good morning you know doctor. I came along to help out"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.54,
      "end_seconds": 26.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 28.75,
      "end_seconds": 33.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "doctor, it's sneezing in spring. That's what we're worried about"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.92,
      "end_seconds": 39.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Can I check a a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.75,
      "end_seconds": 50.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.37,
      "end_seconds": 72.58,
      "duration_seconds": 11.21,
      "text": "Okay: height 172 centimetres pulse 67 oxygen saturation is 99 percent temperature is 36.8 degrees blood pressure 116 over 73 weight 78 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.93,
      "end_seconds": 76.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.97,
      "end_seconds": 84.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "we'll look at it together shortly how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.65,
      "end_seconds": 86.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Probably about a week. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.0,
      "end_seconds": 91.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "right, any a runny itchy nose as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.01,
      "end_seconds": 105.83,
      "duration_seconds": 11.82,
      "text": "yes, uh, for five days about runny itchy nose, maybe a five out of ten on a bad day and watery eyes, too"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.25,
      "end_seconds": 113.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "okay, have you had sneezing in spring before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.27,
      "end_seconds": 120.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last year, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.73,
      "end_seconds": 126.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "did you get wheeze, facial pain or loss of smell?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.76,
      "end_seconds": 132.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "No no wheeze facial pain or loss of smell."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.1,
      "end_seconds": 134.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.4,
      "end_seconds": 139.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "No I haven't had any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.47,
      "end_seconds": 142.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.73,
      "end_seconds": 145.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "nothing unusual, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.3,
      "end_seconds": 148.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "okay your breathing any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.57,
      "end_seconds": 151.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.55,
      "end_seconds": 155.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Okay, what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 155.94,
      "end_seconds": 159.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "It's omeprazole, once a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.0,
      "end_seconds": 162.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Alright, how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 164.51,
      "end_seconds": 172.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.43,
      "text": "20 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. Right, it's loratadine, 10 milligrams, once a day, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.5,
      "end_seconds": 177.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.75,
      "end_seconds": 185.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "well, I have acid reflux. I did try to ignore it for a while"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.56,
      "end_seconds": 191.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.81,
      "end_seconds": 194.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "yes, an enlarged prostate"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.84,
      "end_seconds": 206.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "okay, go on alright, acid reflux and an enlarged prostate, that matches what I have here have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.03,
      "end_seconds": 213.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.02,
      "end_seconds": 218.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Alright anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.58,
      "end_seconds": 223.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.16,
      "end_seconds": 226.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Alright what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.01,
      "end_seconds": 230.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.4,
      "end_seconds": 236.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.1,
      "end_seconds": 243.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.23,
      "end_seconds": 261.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.59,
      "end_seconds": 267.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "yeah, um, no, I've never reacted to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.82,
      "end_seconds": 273.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Right, could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.89,
      "end_seconds": 276.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.27,
      "end_seconds": 299.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "the inside of the nose is pale and boggy with clear mucus"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.81,
      "end_seconds": 306.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.41,
      "end_seconds": 323.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Okay thinking it through my working impression is seasonal allergic rhinitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.68,
      "end_seconds": 326.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.78,
      "end_seconds": 336.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.85,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the the moment I'd say it's seasonal allergic rhinitis, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.42,
      "end_seconds": 375.92,
      "duration_seconds": 26.5,
      "text": "The treatment will be fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day, the season. That's for hay fever. Shower after being outdoors and keep windows shut when pollen is high. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.83,
      "end_seconds": 378.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "okay, makes sense"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.45,
      "end_seconds": 386.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "I'd like you back if not better in a month. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 388.21,
      "end_seconds": 391.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Right I'll do that. Thank you doctor."
    }
  ]
}